example.para:
The following example shows a PDO_IBM DSN for connecting to an DB2 database cataloged as DB2_9 in db2cli.ini:
$db = new PDO("ibm:DSN=DB2_9", "", "");
[DB2_9] Database=testdb Protocol=tcpip Hostname=11.22.33.444 Servicename=56789

       The following example shows a PDO_INFORMIX DSN for connecting to
       an Informix database named common_db using the
       Informix connection string syntax.

$db = new PDO("informix:host=host.domain.com; service=9800;
    database=common_db; server=ids_server; protocol=onsoctcp;
    EnableScrollableCursors=1", "testuser", "tespass");

      The following example shows how to connect to a MS SQL Server database on
      a specified port:


$c = new PDO("sqlsrv:Server=localhost,1521;Database=testdb", "UserName", "Password");

