refsect1.para:
   The following two statements are functionally identical.  The
   bcpowmod version however, executes in
   less time and can accept larger parameters.



<?php
$a = bcpowmod($x, $y, $mod);

$b = bcmod(bcpow($x, $y), $mod);

// $a and $b are equal to each other.

?>

